warning[mixed_case_hex_literals]: `0xDeadbeef` mixes upper and lower case digits
  --> tests/lint/mixed_case_hex_literals/bad.jai:3:9
   |
 3 | MASK :: 0xDeadbeef;
   |         ^^^^^^^^^^
   |
help: write `0xdeadbeef`
   |
 3 ~ MASK :: 0xdeadbeef;
   |
   = note: `mixed_case_hex_literals` is `warn` by default

warning[mixed_case_hex_literals]: `0xFFfF` mixes upper and lower case digits
  --> tests/lint/mixed_case_hex_literals/bad.jai:6:10
   |
 6 |     a := 0xFFfF;
   |          ^^^^^^
   |
help: write `0xFFFF`
   |
 6 ~     a := 0xFFFF;
   |
   = note: `mixed_case_hex_literals` is `warn` by default

